  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Accidental collision – compensation for damaged goods and vehicle repairs.</span></li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Unforeseen delays – reimbursement for storage costs and per‑day loss of use.</span></li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Natural calamities – coverage for flood, landslide, or extreme weather impacts.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>When selecting a service, consider reputable operators such as <em>goyal packing moving packers and movers in bangalore indiamart</em>, <em>ms packers and movers bangalore kr puram bangalore</em>, and <em>global packers and movers bangalore</em>. For specialized shipments, companies like <em>tasmanian furniture transport</em> offer expertise in handling delicate items.</p>
<p>If you’re planning a <em>home shifting bngalore</em>, request a detailed checklist that includes the e‑Way bill, LR, and insurance certificate to avoid surprises.</p>

<p>By ensuring all statutory documents are in order and securing full‑value IRDAI marine insurance, you protect your assets and enjoy a hassle‑free relocation from Dumka to Bangalore.</p></div>
