      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Doorstep Delivery Handover, Inventory Verification &amp; Placement at Bangalore</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When the final delivery arrives at the Bangalore warehouse, the first step is a daylight‑time verification against the original inventory bilty. The receiving clerk opens the bilty, cross‑checks the manifest numbers, and inspects each container for visible damage.</p>
<p>Any discrepancy is logged immediately and the carrier is notified before the pallet is moved. This ensures that the inventory count on‑hand matches the paperwork and prevents costly post‑delivery adjustments.</p>

<p>After verification, the uncrating process begins. All pallets are placed on a designated staging area and each box is opened in a systematic order – front to back, left to right. The contents are then laid out on clean, level tables so that fragile items can be inspected without risk of further damage.</p>

